+           "_key": "a51fa2988ef2",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [
+             "756dee7044b0"
+           ],
+           "text": "Akhmim"
+         },
+         {
+           "_key": "c6a41321df31",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [],
+           "text": " is celebrated for its enduring contribution to Egypt’s cultural heritage, especially through its ancient crafts in weaving, textiles, and drapery. These trades are among "
+         },
+         {
+           "_key": "91b46402b3a3",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [
+             "ec4af2251093"
+           ],
+           "text": "Egypt’s"
+         },
+         {
+           "_key": "799a2d0176b3",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [],
+           "text": " oldest, symbolizing the town’s historical significance and its artisans’ skillful dedication to preserving these ancient practices. The heart of Akhmim buzzes with life, especially around its vibrant "
+         },
+         {
+           "_key": "07d646f0bbae",
+           "_type": "span",
+           "marks": [
+             "42f7e0b9d122"
+           ],
+           "text": "shops and the local"
+         },
